WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.001 --> 00:00:07.422
The touch toolbar is now the default. The large, labeled
buttons sit below the canvas, within easy reach.

2
00:00:07.923 --> 00:00:14.668
Turn on Keep tool, then choose Rectangle. Draw one box, then
draw another without going back to the toolbar.

3
00:00:15.170 --> 00:00:17.170
Switch to Ellipse for the third shape.

4
00:00:17.901 --> 00:00:24.011
Select moves the shapes. Pan moves the whole canvas. For
now, let's leave all three shapes in view.
